  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nI am still using Homarr v0.15.10, in this version and ones before I could change the port number to 80 using an environment variable within Docker Compose, - PORT=80. With the new 1.2 release I cannot do the same. According to Meierschlumpf the port number is locked to 7575. I prefer to assign each container a static IP and add each to DNS so I can use FQDN on my network. Thanks for the work done on this.\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
