      "body": "In our current container we have the following ports allocated:\n- **3000:** NextJS webapp (what you see)\n- **3001:** Websocket server (Realtime updates)\n- **6379:** Redis server (Realtime updates & Caching)\n- **7575:** Nginx reverse proxy (To expose 3000 and 3001 under one port)",
