      "updated_at": "2025-03-18T21:17:34Z",
      "body": "I've switched to using `PUID` and `PGID` environment variables in place of `--user` and now everything launches as normal.\n\nI'll close the other GH Issue that I made as this addresses that. I understand `--user uid:gid` and `PUID/PGID` to be roughly equivalent so I'm not super concerned.",
